        "detailed_description": "🥰 101 Dogs Hidden in Berlin invites you on a cozy journey to find dogs hidden in a beautiful hand-crafted landscape inspired by travels around the world. 🗺️<br><br>🍂 Explore a calm and relaxing hidden objects experience full of dogs, where every corner may hide cute hidden dogs waiting to be discovered. Perfect for players who enjoy cozy, calm, zen games about animals and peaceful exploration.<br><br>🎵 While searching for hidden pets and hidden dogs, enjoy a tranquil soundtrack designed to help you relax and unwind.<br><br>🐶 Earn TONS of achievements while discovering every cute animal hidden in the scenery.<br><br>🏆 Become the ULTIMATE CHALLENGER and invite your friends to see who can find dogs the fastest! ⏱️ Speedrun with your friends? YES! 🚀<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >GAMEPLAY:</h2>🐾 It’s 101 hidden dogs in a single beautiful landscape — a world full of dogs waiting to be discovered.<br>👉 Click on every hidden dog you find.<br>👀 Adjust brightness for a more relaxing and comfortable experience. ✅<br>🔎 Use the AMAZING ZOOM to spot the tiniest hidden objects and sneaky puppies.<br><br>🐕 A cozy, calm and zen animal adventure for players who love cute dogs, relaxing exploration, and hidden object challenges.<br><br>Perfect for fans of Hidden Objects, Animal Fest, and cozy discovery games during Sale events.<br><br>🐕‍🦺🦴🦮🐩",
